es, and complete the level. If you can't find the answer, our scientist will help you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What demo includes?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo includes 1\u00a0<strong>tutorial</strong> level\u00a0and 3 levels <strong>unrelated to the story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tutorial level features <strong>all five elementals</strong> from the full game, along with <strong>interactable</strong> objects like wireboxes, batteries, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Estimated playtime: <strong>around 5 minutes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["KUP Interactive"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3540580","name":"Elemental Slime"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659300/375b96fa3a6d5814568d3765435c019030d1756d/header.jpg?t=1744965845","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124381,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124381/movie480.mp4?t=1744965844","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124381/movie_max.mp4?t=1744965844"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257124381/d3ca96295a2d85bc29dea06b925a59d94e073ba8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744965844","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124381/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744965844","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124381/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744965844"}}],"name":"Elemental Slime Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64-bit only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3-8100 / AMD Ryzen\u2122 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><l